{
    "id":  11243,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Angular LED Connector 9W | POLARIS | Linear Interconnection | 3CCT | 90º",
    "reference":  "LN9W-3CCT-92089",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAngular LED Connector 90º - L 9W,\u003c/strong\u003e specifically designed for use in \u003cstrong\u003ePOLARIS\u003c/strong\u003e linear LED pendant lamps. \u003cstrong\u003eDesigned to join two luminaires continuously thanks to its 90º angular shape,\u003c/strong\u003e this connector transforms any space with exclusive and customizable lighting.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts assembly is quick and simple, as it includes all the necessary accessories for hassle-free installation. Additionally, \u003cstrong\u003eits innovative design allows light to pass through the ends\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a continuous visual effect that adds elegance and sophistication to your environments. Make every corner shine with style!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e90º Angular LED Connector 9W - POLARIS - Linear Interconnection - 3CCT\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLink your \u003cstrong\u003ePOLARIS\u003c/strong\u003e luminaires with the \u003cstrong\u003e90º Angular L LED Connector 9W\u003c/strong\u003e. Designed for POLARIS LED Linear Pendant Lamps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Innovative Design:\u003c/strong\u003e 90º angular shape for continuous corner connection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Quick Easy Mounting:\u003c/strong\u003e All accessories included. Surface or pendant mounting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Continuous Visual Effect:\u003c/strong\u003e Light passes through ends.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExact 90° angle\u003c/strong\u003e for precise corners\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo electrical versions: \u003cstrong\u003eVersion A\u003c/strong\u003e (both conductive), \u003cstrong\u003eVersion B\u003c/strong\u003e (one conductive, one not)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRobust construction, easy installation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModular system compatibility\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant:\u003c/strong\u003e Only one luminaire of the set must be connected to power supply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConfigurations:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSquare form:\u003c/strong\u003e 3 type A + 1 type B connectors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eU form:\u003c/strong\u003e A+A (1 power), A+B (2 powers)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL form:\u003c/strong\u003e connector A (1 power), B (2 powers)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eApplications: Offices, commercial, modern residential.\u003c/h3\u003e",
